{"id":515,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"全寮制と英語で鍛える秀明中学校","feature_description":"秀明中学校は「知は力なり」を掲げ、全寮制の生活の中で到達度別学習と英語教育を徹底する学校です。中学1年からクラブ活動に参加し、学習と生活を一体で整えます。寮生活、学校生活、クラブ活動の導線が明確で、日々の成長像をつかみやすいです。日々の積み重ねで自分の役割を見つけ、学習と活動を両立しやすい環境です。学校生活の見通しも立てやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":10091,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shumei.ac.jp/intro/guide/skill/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10092,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shumei.ac.jp/intro/guide/skill/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10093,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shumei.ac.jp/intro/guide/skill/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10094,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shumei.ac.jp/intro/guide/skill/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10095,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shumei.ac.jp/intro/guide/skill/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10096,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shumei.ac.jp/intro/guide/skill/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10097,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shumei.ac.jp/intro/guide/skill/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10098,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shumei.ac.jp/intro/guide/skill/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10099,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shumei.ac.jp/intro/guide/skill/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10100,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shumei.ac.jp/intro/guide/skill/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10101,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shumei.ac.jp/intro/guide/skill/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10102,"name":"スキー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shumei.ac.jp/intro/guide/skill/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10103,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://shumei.ac.jp/intro/guide/skill/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10104,"name":"ブラスバンド部","category":"文化部","sou